{"ID":"20230928084020-yw8htls","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20230928084020-yw8htls","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928084020-yw8htls\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928084026-w6er4zx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928084403-2c13rxg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1041,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928084403-2c13rxg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"【正经】【足太阳膀胱经】","type":"doc","updated":"20240912173732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240912165233-oipfhlb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240912165233-oipfhlb","updated":"20240912173709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【足太阳膀胱经穴位】：睛明穴、攒竹穴、眉冲穴、曲差穴、五处穴、承光穴、通天穴、络却穴、玉枕穴、天柱穴、大杼穴、风门穴、肺俞穴、厥阴俞穴、心俞穴、督俞穴、膈俞穴、肝俞穴、胆俞穴、脾俞穴、胃俞穴、三焦俞穴、肾俞穴、气海俞穴、大肠俞穴、关元俞穴、小肠俞穴、 膀胱俞 穴、中膂俞穴、 白环俞穴、上髎穴、次髎穴、中髎穴、下髎穴、会阳穴、承扶穴、殷门穴、浮郄穴、委阳穴、委中穴、附分穴、魄户穴、膏肓穴、神堂穴、譩譆穴、膈关穴、魂门穴、阳纲穴、意舍穴、胃仓穴、肓门穴、志室穴、胞肓 穴、秩边 穴、合阳穴、 承筋穴、承山穴、飞扬穴、跗阳穴、昆仑穴、仆参穴、申脉穴、金门穴、京骨穴、束骨穴、足通谷穴、至阴穴。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928084026-w6er4zx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084026-w6er4zx","updated":"20230928084301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"膀胱，州都之官，津液出焉（气化）；膀胱位于小肠之下；小肠属火，膀胱属水；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084026-qerpb6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084026-qerpb6t","updated":"20230928084315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"水进入膀胱的方式：第一种为泌别，即三焦把膀胱包住，从油网渗透进去；第二种是从肾脏，从输尿管流向膀胱；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084026-h2innl6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084026-h2innl6","updated":"20230928084316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾与膀胱相表里；所以下针在膀胱经时针会下的深，一般都会碰到骨头，所以穴位要对准；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084318-feihc64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084318-feihc64"}},{"ID":"20230928084026-mt2nic7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084026-mt2nic7","updated":"20230928084320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"井\t金\t脏\t至阴穴\t\t母穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928084026-5mwhu31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084026-5mwhu31","updated":"20230928084320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"荣\t水\t色\t足通谷穴\t\t本穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928084026-fba8ju5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084026-fba8ju5","updated":"20230928084321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"俞\t木\t时\t束骨穴\t\t子穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928084026-fqg7uuj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084026-fqg7uuj","updated":"20230928084322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"经\t火\t音\t昆仑穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928084026-0ivs81y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084026-0ivs81y","updated":"20230928084322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"合\t土\t食\t委中穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928084324-nahnu9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084324-nahnu9a"}},{"ID":"20230928084026-8m5tqrn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084026-8m5tqrn","updated":"20230928084326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"委阳穴：足太阳经络穴，不是正络，属别络；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084026-am1dvr7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084026-am1dvr7","updated":"20230928084326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"委中穴：膀胱经的合穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084026-sg5e5rx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084026-sg5e5rx","updated":"20230928084327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"飞扬穴：膀胱经的络穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084026-955t8zs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084026-955t8zs","updated":"20230928084328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"跗阳穴：阳跷脉的郄穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084026-9gnj5up","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084026-9gnj5up","updated":"20230928084328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"昆仑穴：膀胱经的经穴；（孕妇不能下针，会落胎）"}]},{"ID":"20230928084026-qbfrs0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084026-qbfrs0x","updated":"20230928084329"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"申脉穴：主阳跷脉，阳跷脉都是申脉在管；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084026-twr5byo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084026-twr5byo","updated":"20230928084330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"金门穴：膀胱经的郄穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084026-m414ozr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084026-m414ozr","updated":"20230928084330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"京骨穴：膀胱经的原穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928084337-g9dcpcv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084337-g9dcpcv"}},{"ID":"20230928084337-2wc45ne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084337-2wc45ne"}},{"ID":"20230928084026-yefkp32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084026-yefkp32","updated":"20230928084331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"膀胱经位于督脉左右外开一寸半，六十七穴："}]},{"ID":"20230928084035-2okqa5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084035-2okqa5p"}},{"ID":"20230928084332-bmdyr5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084332-bmdyr5q"}},{"ID":"20230928084357-frvb5kq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928084357-frvb5kq","updated":"20230928084357"},"Children":[